  "name": "Venomancer forms show the matching druid form incarnations",
  "contract": [
    "AppearanceCategories.dbc rows 17-23 (Bear, Cat, Travel, Aquatic, Flight, Moonkin, Tree of Life) carry the Venomancer class bit (class 29, mask 0x10000000) and in field 21 the Venomancer form: Beetle Form 53, Spider Form 52, Venomwing Form 47, Weaver Form 54, Vizier Form 62. Wasp Form 805141 already is form 29 (Flight Form).",
    "A Venomancer's selection is accepted and each form takes the selected display while it lasts: appearance 822 = 1083, 645 = 328642, 506 = 100536, 47621 = 80084, 15595 = 110039, 15605 = 39801 (Appearances.dbc field 8). Leaving the form restores the character; without a selection the form keeps its own model.",
    "A Druid keeps its incarnations (Cat Form 768 with appearance 645 = 328642) and a class outside the mask is still refused. Cast in Hellfire Peninsula, outdoors in Outland, where Venomwing Form and Wasp Form are usable."
  ],
